Program          : DRVEC 0.12
Input Data File  : the .pre files
Output File      : cprq.out
Model            : VARMA-VECM(2,1), M = 2 series, cointegration rank r = 0..1 (sequential test)
Estimation       : Exact Unconditional Maximum Likelihood, Algorithm AS 311 (Mauricio 1997), xi sequence truncated at 1e-3
Transformation   : VECM to stationary VARMA (Mauricio 2006)
Deterministic    : case 3 -- E[nabla Y2] free, E[W] free (drifts as in the .pre files)
Structure        : F free, Theta free (the default; -mafree), Sigma free
Series           : muskrat mink   (1 in the nabla Y2 block, 1 in Y1)
Sample           : 61 observations from 1851, annual (raw 62)

